WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.397
The sun was high in the sky.

2
00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:17.448
And it was very hot.

3
00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:24.042
"Ugh! It's so hot today," said Bird.

4
00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:28.827
"This is the hottest day ever!" said Kip.

5
00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.715
"Let's go to the beach," said Bird.

6
00:00:31.716 --> 00:00:35.148
"We can cool off in the water."

7
00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:41.639
The two friends walked.

8
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:54.799
Even the sidewalk was hot.

9
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.656
"Ouch! My feet!" said Bird.

10
00:00:59.657 --> 00:01:02.724
Bird hopped from one foot to the other.

11
00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:07.492
"Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!" said Kip.

12
00:01:07.493 --> 00:01:11.312
Kip hopped too.

13
00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:14.329
They hopped all the way to the beach.

14
00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:23.606
The beach was crowded.

15
00:01:23.607 --> 00:01:27.316
"Look at all these feet," said Bird.

16
00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:33.243
"I can't see the ocean," said Kip.

17
00:01:33.244 --> 00:01:37.196
Bird and Kip walked through the crowd.

18
00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:46.919
Then they saw the water.

19
00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:50.054
The waves were too big for a small bird.

20
00:01:50.055 --> 00:01:59.005
And they were too big for a chipmunk.

21
00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:02.669
"We can't go in the water," said Kip.

22
00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:07.259
"How are we going to cool off?"
